<title>UK: Goldman Sachs set warrants on the Nikkei 225 index.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs set warrants on the Nikkei 225 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier GmbH has issued three million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the  Nikkei 225 index, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co oHG said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 22.JAN.97-16.APR.98   PAYDATE	21.JAN.97</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    100			 SPOT REF     18000</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	STRIKE	 ISSUE	 PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A    16000	  4.15 DEM    5.20 PCT     5.97 X</p>
<p> CALL B    18000	  2.44 DEM    9.36 PCT     10.15 X</p>
<p> CALL C    19000	  1.78 DEM    12.22 PCT    13.91 X</p>
<p> CALL D    21000	  0.88 DEM    19.64 PCT    28.14 X</p>
<p> PUT A     16000	  1.32 DEM    16.88 PCT    18.76 X</p>
<p> PUT B     18000	  2.33 DEM    9.91 PCT     10.59 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
